.TH DEB-INSPECTOR 1 "November 2026" "1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
deb-inspector \- inspect and safely install local .deb packages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B deb-inspector
[\fIFILE.deb\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A lightweight GTK3 graphical utility to inspect Debian package metadata, preview APT dependency simulations, and safely install local .deb files.
